OL,3,GNEWSAEmergency crews to be honoured on
OL,4,A999 Day
OL,5,
OL,6,FEmergency service workers who have died
OL,7,Fin the line of duty are to be
OL,8,Fremembered as 999 Day when it is marked
OL,9,Fat the National Memorial Arboretum.
OL,11,FThe day, which takes places annually
OL,12,Facross the UK on 9 September,
OL,13,Frecognises the work of emergency crews
OL,14,Fand those in public service who lost
OL,15,Ftheir lives.
OL,17,FAt the Staffordshire arboretum, wreaths
OL,18,Fwill be laid at the Ambulance Services,
OL,19,FFire and Rescue Services and UK Police
OL,20,FMemorials.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
